<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Holderbank.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Holderbank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Holderbank bearer shares, lead manager the Goldman Sachs Group said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1500 SFR		  PREMIUM	17.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.50 SFR		  GEARING	10.81 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	12.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1390 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   GSJR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
